1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,289
Compare the three.

2
00:00:01,289 --> 00:00:05,091
Arrhenius is the narrowest, tied to water.

3
00:00:05,091 --> 00:00:07,617
Bronsted and Lowry is wider.

4
00:00:07,617 --> 00:00:18,841
Lewis is the widest, but it is so wide that it says nothing about the relative strengths of acids, and it even struggles to call hydrochloric acid an acid in the strict sense.

